    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Present your services professionally with a polished &#8220;Our Services&#8221; section your clients will trust – built right in the block editor, no code required.</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/services-section/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Services Section</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/services-section/#demos\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Demos</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/services-section/pricing\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Pricing</strong></a></p>\n<h3>Why Services Section Block?</h3>\n<p><strong>Services Section Block</strong> adds a new block to the Block Editor that lets you create a professional-looking services or &#8220;OUR SERVICE&#8221; section in minutes. It is very effective at presenting your services nicely, with many options to decorate your section using any colors you like.</p>\n<p>Pick an icon from the built-in icon library (or upload your own PNG, JPEG, or JPG), start from a ready-made template, and fine-tune typography for titles and descriptions until the section matches your brand.</p>\n<h3>Free Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Icon Library:</strong> Select the icon of your choice from the built-in library, or upload any image in PNG, JPEG, or JPG format as a service icon.</li>\n<li><strong>Built-in Templates:</strong> Start from ready-made templates whenever you want to present your services.</li>\n<li><strong>Customizable Elements:</strong> Apply custom typography to the title and description.</li>\n<li><strong>Color Options:</strong> Decorate your service section using any color you like.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Pro Version – Unlock Advanced Layouts &amp; Styling</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/services-section/pricing\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Get Pro Version</strong></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Advanced Layout Variations:</strong> Unlock exclusive layouts (Layout 2 to Layout 8) with unique styles and structures.</li>\n<li><strong>Pro-Level Padding &amp; Spacing Controls:</strong> Set custom padding and spacing per side with more flexibility.</li>\n<li><strong>Enhanced Border Customization:</strong> Full border controls including individual side styles and advanced radius options.</li>\n<li><strong>Animation Direction Settings:</strong> Directional animation control for layout-specific designs like Layout 4.</li>\n<li><strong>Border Div Customization (Layout 8):</strong> Toggle and style an additional decorative border layer behind items.</li>\n<li><strong>Advanced Shadow Effects:</strong> Smooth box shadows and hover transitions for modern aesthetics.</li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Linking Options:</strong> Enable links on items and choose where they apply – button, title, or entire box.</li>\n<li><strong>Open in New Tab:</strong> Choose whether links open in a new browser tab.</li>\n<li><strong>Opacity &amp; Hover Opacity:</strong> Control the transparency of the circle background, including on hover.</li>\n<li><strong>Radius &amp; Border:</strong> Control corner roundness and customize border style, width, and color.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to Use Services Section Block – Quick Start</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the <strong>Services Section Block</strong> plugin.</li>\n<li>In the Gutenberg editor, add the <strong>Services Section</strong> block from the <strong>Widgets</strong> block category.</li>\n<li>Add your services, choose icons from the library or upload your own images.</li>\n<li>Pick a template and adjust colors and typography from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>Publish – enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Use Cases</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Agencies &amp; Freelancers:</strong> Present design, development, or marketing services in a clean grid.</li>\n<li><strong>Local Businesses:</strong> Showcase what you offer with icons and short descriptions.</li>\n<li><strong>Corporate Sites:</strong> Build a polished &#8220;Our Services&#8221; page section with consistent branding.</li>\n<li><strong>Landing Pages:</strong> Highlight key offerings with linked service cards (Pro).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Did you like this plugin? Do you have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:support@bplugins.com\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">B Blocks</a></strong> – Gutenberg blocks collection for WordPress.</p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Audio player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Video player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – A fully-featured PDF Viewer Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/document-embedder\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Document Embedder</a></strong> – WordPress Document Embedder Plugin.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models on the web.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Advanced Post Block</a></strong> – Post Display Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>From your WordPress dashboard (recommended):</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong>.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>&#8220;Services Section&#8221;</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n<li>In the Gutenberg editor, search for the <strong>Services Section</strong> block and add it to any post or page.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Manual installation:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>Services Section</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>).</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Upload Plugin</strong>, choose the <strong><code>services-section.zip</code></strong> file, and click <strong>Install Now</strong>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"is%20services%20section%20block%20free%3F\">\nIs Services Section Block free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Services Section Block is a free Gutenberg block plugin. A Pro version with advanced layouts and styling controls is also available.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it works with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20use%20my%20own%20images%20as%20service%20icons%3F\">\nCan I use my own images as service icons?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. If the icon you want is not in the built-in icon library, you can upload any image in PNG, JPEG, or JPG format and set it as a service icon.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"are%20there%20ready-made%20templates%3F\">\nAre there ready-made templates?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Several built-in templates are included so you can present your services quickly without designing from scratch.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20add%20links%20to%20service%20items%3F\">\nCan I add links to service items?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, in the Pro version you can enable links on items and choose where they apply – on the button, the title, or the entire box – and whether they open in a new tab.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F\">\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change all block settings from the right sidebar of the Gutenberg block editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20the%20block%3F\">\nHow many times can I reuse the block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use the block an unlimited number of times across posts and pages.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F\">\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/services-section/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4.4 &#8211; 09 April, 26</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fixed:</strong> Class naming conflict and namespace resolution issue in LicenseActivation.</li>\n<li><strong>Updated:</strong> Freemius SDK to latest version.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.3 &#8211; 28 Feb, 26</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update brand new dashboard with license activation support</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.2 &#8211; 24 Jan, 26</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved section title formatting in dashboard</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.1 &#8211; 04 Nov, 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>update sdk</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.0 &#8211; 15 October, 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>added modern dashboard and layout switch in toolbar</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.8 &#8211; 28 July 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>updated admin dashboard page</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.7 &#8211; 20 May 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>escapeHTML imported from common</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.6 &#8211; 6 May 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve Admin dashboard demo page</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.5 &#8211; 17 Feb 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve security</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.4 &#8211; 28 Dec 24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix default image not found issue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update font library</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix empty link</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce assets load</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove the link if no link</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add translate feature</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix HTML Render</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce PHP Code</li>\n<li>Performance Improvement</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the default icon issue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce PHP Code</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Performance upgrade</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Performance upgrade</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update theme and link position settings in the global</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add an option for the link in the whole service element</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add options for hover background</li>\n<li>Fix the upload icon</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix align issues</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix issues</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Templates</li>\n<li>Add more settings</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix align class</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Icon Upload Option</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
